table = Month,Produced,Consumed,Net,Surplus; Jan,"3,120","7,940","-4,820",; Feb,"4,080","7,410","-3,330",; Mar,"5,960","7,020","-1,060",; Apr,"7,340","6,650",+690,**yes**; May,"8,810","6,480","+2,330",**yes**; Jun,"9,470","7,210","+2,260",**yes**; Jul,"9,620","7,860","+1,760",**yes**; Aug,"8,730","7,590","+1,140",**yes**; Sep,"6,890","6,720",+170,**yes**; Oct,"4,910","7,130","-2,220",

Net is produced minus consumed, in kWh. The array ran a surplus every month from April through September.

# Notes
The inverter was down for 4 days in March, which lowered that month's production.

! The board will vote on adding battery storage on 2026-11-12.
